{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人梁杰文於節目中表示，看好中國人壽(2628)，理由是半年盈利遠超市場預期，加上新業務價值高速增長，走勢持續跑贏同業，均利好股價後市表現。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3323.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026FmPhTu9CYN1784695937.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">梁杰文建議於現價、即約27.98元水平買入，目標價定於31元，若後市失守24元就先行止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>中國人壽(2628)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價→$27.98入</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$31</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$24</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3324.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026wMTqzuK2Zv1784695953.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人阮子曦則提出部署創科實業(669)，主要看好集團業績增長，表現也相當穩定，加上旗下電鑽品牌MILWAUKE利潤率相對較高，佔比也逐步擴大。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3325.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20269aVA6Vezom1784695979.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">阮子曦建議於現價、即約131.5元水平買入，目標價上望150元，若股價跌穿120元就止蝕離場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">創科實業(669)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　現價→$131.5入</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$150</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$120</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3326.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026bqvgllZDo71784695993.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T07:23:04.595680+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}